msgid ""
"The closed-shell density fitting CC2 program for ground and excited states"
msgstr "用于基态和激发态的闭壳层密度拟合 CC2 程序"

msgid "Bibliography:"
msgstr "参考文献："

msgid ""
"Christof Hättig and Florian Weigend, `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://doi.org/10.1063/1.1290013>`__ **113**, 5154 (2000)"
msgstr ""
"Christof Hättig and Florian Weigend, `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://doi.org/10.1063/1.1290013>`__ **113**, 5154 (2000)"

msgid ""
"Christof Hättig and Andreas Köhn `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://doi.org/10.1063/1.1506918>`__ **117** 6939 (2002)"
msgstr ""
"Christof Hättig and Andreas Köhn `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://doi.org/10.1063/1.1506918>`__ **117** 6939 (2002)"

msgid ""
"To compute ground-state correlation energies using the DF-CC2 program the "
"``df-cc2`` command needs to be added after a Hartree-Fock calculation:"
msgstr "要使用 DF-CC2 程序计算基态相关能，需要在 Hartree-Fock 计算后添加 ``df-cc2`` 命令："

msgid ""
"In order to calculate excitation energies using the DF-CC2 program the "
"``STATES`` option needs to be added to the ``DF-CC2`` command with a list of"
" the required (lowest) excitations of a given symmetry, like"
msgstr ""
"为了使用DF-CC2程序计算激发能，需要在 ``DF-CC2`` 命令中添加 ``STATES`` 选项，并指定所需（最低）的给定对称性激发列表，例如"

msgid ""
"which will calculate :math:`5` states in symmetry :math:`1`, :math:`3` "
"states in symmetry :math:`4` and :math:`4` states in symmetry :math:`6`, as "
"an example. Of course, the number of states and symmetries need to be "
"consistent with the current global settings in Molpro regarding symmetry and"
" basis set sizes. Excitation energies are saved in the 1-rank array variable"
" ``OMEGA``."
msgstr ""
"例如，这将计算对称性 :math:`1` 中的 :math:`5` 个态、对称性 :math:`4` 中的 :math:`3` 个态以及对称性 "
":math:`6` 中的 :math:`4` "
"个态。当然，态的数量和对称性需要与Molpro中关于对称性和基组大小的当前全局设置保持一致。激发能保存在一维数组变量 ``OMEGA`` 中。"

msgid ""
"Transition moments can also be computed for each excited state by adding the"
" ``TRAMOM`` option"
msgstr "也可以通过添加 ``TRAMOM`` 选项为每个激发态计算跃迁矩"

msgid ""
"which will also automatically compute the (unrelaxed) ground state CC2 "
"dipole moment. The latter can also be obtained using either the option "
"``DIPOLE``\\ :math:`=1` or ``DM``\\ :math:`=\\langle record\\rangle.\\langle"
" file \\rangle` where the latter also saves the density matrix in a dump "
"record with the corresponding name :math:`\\langle record\\rangle.\\langle "
"file \\rangle`. Both options ``DIPOLE`` or ``DM`` do not require the "
"calculation of excited states, of course."
msgstr ""
"这也会自动计算（未弛豫的）基态CC2偶极矩。后者也可以通过选项 ``DIPOLE``\\ :math:`=1` 或 ``DM``\\ "
":math:`=\\langle record\\rangle.\\langle file \\rangle` "
"获得，其中后者还将密度矩阵保存在具有相应名称 :math:`\\langle record\\rangle.\\langle file "
"\\rangle` 的转储记录中。当然，选项 ``DIPOLE`` 或 ``DM`` 都不需要计算激发态。"

msgid ""
"The transition dipole moments are saved in the variables ``TM_L_X``, "
"``TM_L_Y`` and ``TM_L_Z`` for the left vector densities and ``TM_R_X``, "
"``TM_R_Y`` and ``TM_R_Z`` for the corresponding right vector densities, "
"respectively. The values are ordered according to the excitations computed "
"consecutively. The corresponding transition quadrupole moments (not "
"traceless!) are being saved in the variables ``TMQ_L_XX``, ``TMQ_L_YY``, "
"etc."
msgstr ""
"跃迁偶极矩分别保存在变量 ``TM_L_X``\\ 、\\ ``TM_L_Y`` 和 ``TM_L_Z``\\ （用于左矢量密度）以及 "
"``TM_R_X``\\ 、\\ ``TM_R_Y`` 和 ``TM_R_Z``\\ "
"（用于相应的右矢量密度）中。这些值按照连续计算的激发顺序排列。相应的跃迁四极矩（非无迹！）保存在变量 ``TMQ_L_XX``\\ 、\\ "
"``TMQ_L_YY`` 等中。"

msgid ""
"The following list summarises further options which can be set in the ``DF-"
"CC2`` program in order to finetune the convergence thresholds, among other "
"things. Note that some options are only being used in very specific parts of"
" the program and so do not globally change anything unless the code branches"
" out to those parts."
msgstr ""
"以下列表总结了可以在 ``DF-CC2`` "
"程序中设置的进一步选项，以便微调收敛阈值等。请注意，某些选项仅用于程序的非常特定部分，因此除非代码分支到这些部分，否则不会全局更改任何内容。"

msgid "**STATES:STATE** Requested states"
msgstr "**STATES:STATE** 请求的态"

msgid "**START** Start record"
msgstr "**START** 起始记录"

msgid "**SAVE** Save record"
msgstr "**SAVE** 保存记录"

msgid ""
"The CC2 method is an approximate CCSD (coupled-cluster singles and doubles) "
"method which retains the same singles equation as the CCSD model, but in "
"which the doubles amplitude equation is approximated to first order in the "
":math:`T_2` amplitudes only. This has the major advantage that then storage "
"of quantities that scale as :math:`N^4` with the system size either on disk "
"or in memory can be avoided by the aid of density fitting. A corresponding "
"density fitting implementation of CC2 has been derived by `Hättig and "
"Weigend <https://doi.org/10.1063/1.1290013>`__ and has the advantage that "
"ground and excited state energies and properties can be computed for systems"
" much large in size than are possible with standard CCSD and beyond wave "
"function methods. Note that a separate local CC2 program is also available "
"in Molpro which further reduces the :math:`N^5` scaling of DF-CC2 to linear "
"scaling with the aid of localisation of orbitals, see section :doc:`Local "
"methods for excited states <local_methods_for_excited_states>`."
msgstr ""
"CC2 方法是一种近似的 CCSD（耦合簇单双激发）方法，它保留了与 CCSD 模型相同的单激发方程，但其中双激发振幅方程仅在 :math:`T_2` "
"振幅的一阶近似下处理。这带来了一个主要优势：此时可以借助密度拟合避免在磁盘或内存中存储随体系规模按 :math:`N^4` 标度的量。\\ "
"`Hättig and Weigend <https://doi.org/10.1063/1.1290013>`__ 推导了相应的 CC2 "
"密度拟合实现，其优势在于可以为比标准 CCSD 及更高阶波函数方法所能处理的规模大得多的体系计算基态和激发态能量及性质。注意，Molpro "
"中还提供了单独的局域 CC2 程序，它借助轨道局域化进一步将 DF-CC2 的 :math:`N^5` 标度降低为线性标度，参见 :doc:`Local"
" methods for excited states <local_methods_for_excited_states>` 一节。"

msgid ""
"Christiansen, H. Koch, and P. Jørgensen, `Chem. Phys. Lett. "
"<https://doi.org/10.1016/0009-2614(95)00841-Q>`__ **243**, 409 (1995)"
msgstr ""
"Christiansen, H. Koch, and P. Jørgensen, `Chem. Phys. Lett. "
"<https://doi.org/10.1016/0009-2614(95)00841-Q>`__ **243**, 409 (1995)"

msgid ""
"This saves the total CC2 energy in the standard variable ``ENERGY`` as "
"usual. By default, it uses the ``MP2Fit`` auxiliary basis set which matches "
"the corresponding orbital basis if available. It is also possible to set the"
" ``MP2Fit`` basis set explicitly in the input file by using, e.g."
msgstr ""
"这会像通常一样将 CC2 总能量保存在标准变量 ``ENERGY`` 中。默认情况下，它使用 ``MP2Fit`` "
"辅助基组，该基组与相应的轨道基组匹配（如果可用）。也可以在输入文件中通过例如以下方式显式设置 ``MP2Fit`` 基组"

msgid ""
"In the corresponding basis block. See section :doc:`Density fitting "
"<density_fitting>` for more info on how to choose the auxiliary basis set "
"for more special cases (usually orbital basis sets other than Dunning type "
"ones)."
msgstr ""
"在相应的基组块中。关于在更多特殊情况下（通常是非 Dunning 类型的轨道基组）如何选择辅助基组，参见 :doc:`Density fitting "
"<density_fitting>` 一节。"

msgid ""
"**CC2_VERSION:CC2_VERS:VERSION** switch between two different CC2 program "
"versions 1 and 2 (default '1')"
msgstr "**CC2_VERSION:CC2_VERS:VERSION** 在两个不同的 CC2 程序版本 1 和 2 之间切换（默认 '1'）"

msgid ""
"**MAXIT** maximum number of macroiterations in first iteration (default "
"'40')"
msgstr "**MAXIT** 第一次迭代中宏迭代的最大次数（默认 '40'）"

msgid ""
"**MAXMIC1:MAXMIC** maximum number of microiterations in first iteration "
"(default '5')"
msgstr "**MAXMIC1:MAXMIC** 第一次迭代中微迭代的最大次数（默认 '5'）"

msgid ""
"**MAXMIC2** maximum number of microiterations after first iteration (default"
" '3')"
msgstr "**MAXMIC2** 第一次迭代之后微迭代的最大次数（默认 '3'）"

msgid "**EXTRASTATE:ADDCCS** Number of additional states in CCS (default '0')"
msgstr "**EXTRASTATE:ADDCCS** CCS 中额外状态的数量（默认 '0'）"

msgid "**MAXDIIS:MAXDIS** Max number if DIIS vectors (default '10')"
msgstr "**MAXDIIS:MAXDIS** DIIS 向量的最大数量（默认 '10'）"

msgid "**USE_GA** If true, use GA (default '0')"
msgstr "**USE_GA** 若为真，则使用 GA（默认 '0'）"

msgid ""
"**USE_BUFFERS:USE_BUF** If true, buffer 3-index integrals in memory (default"
" '1')"
msgstr "**USE_BUFFERS:USE_BUF** 若为真，则在内存中缓冲三中心积分（默认 '1'）"

msgid "**USE_XTRANS:XTRANS** If true, transpose X in 3-ext part (default '0')"
msgstr "**USE_XTRANS:XTRANS** 若为真，则在三外部部分中转置 X（默认 '0'）"

msgid "**MAXDAV** Maximum number of Davidson vectors per state (default '6'"
msgstr "**MAXDAV** 每个状态的 Davidson 向量最大数量（默认 '6'"

msgid "**NOPAIR** If true, omit doubles, i.e. CCS (default '0')"
msgstr "**NOPAIR** 若为真，则省略双激发，即 CCS（默认 '0'）"

msgid "**USE_DPOT** If true, use Cholesky in Davdison (default '0')"
msgstr "**USE_DPOT** 若为真，则在 Davidson 中使用 Cholesky（默认 '0'）"

msgid "**DO_CCS** If true, use CCS start for excited states (default '1')"
msgstr "**DO_CCS** 若为真，则对激发态使用 CCS 起始（默认 '1'）"

msgid "**THRDIIS:THRDIS** Energy threshold for starting DIIS (default '1d-3')"
msgstr "**THRDIIS:THRDIS** 启动 DIIS 的能量阈值（默认 '1d-3'）"

msgid ""
"**FACMIC** Factor of energy threshold between macroiterations (default "
"'0.01d0')"
msgstr "**FACMIC** 宏迭代之间能量阈值的因子（默认 '0.01d0'）"

msgid "**SHIFTS:SHIFT** Denominator shift (default '0d0')"
msgstr "**SHIFTS:SHIFT** 分母位移（默认 '0d0'）"

msgid "**THRCCS** Threshold for CCs guess (default '1d-3')"
msgstr "**THRCCS** CCs 初始猜测的阈值（默认 '1d-3'）"

msgid "**TRIPLET** If true do triplet excitations (default '0')"
msgstr "**TRIPLET** 若为真，则进行三重态激发（默认 '0'）"

msgid "**TRIANG** If true use triangularity in pair loop (default '1')"
msgstr "**TRIANG** 若为真，则在电子对循环中使用三角性（默认 '1'）"

msgid "**DO_LEFT** Compute left eigenvectors if true (default '0')"
msgstr "**DO_LEFT** 若为真，则计算左本征向量（默认 '0'）"

msgid "**DFMODE** Switch for different density fitting modes (default '0')."
msgstr "**DFMODE** 用于不同密度拟合模式的开关（默认 '0'）。"

msgid ""
"**DIIS_LEFT** If true, start optimisation of left eigenvectors with DIIS, so"
" skip Davidson (default '0')"
msgstr "**DIIS_LEFT** 若为真，则用 DIIS 开始左本征向量的优化，即跳过 Davidson（默认 '0'）"

msgid "**TRAMOM** Compute transition moments if true (default '0')"
msgstr "**TRAMOM** 若为真，则计算跃迁矩（默认 '0'）"

msgid "**DIPOL** Compute dipole moments (default '0')"
msgstr "**DIPOL** 计算偶极矩（默认 '0'）"

msgid "**DM** Save density matrix the the record specified (default '0.0')"
msgstr "**DM** 将密度矩阵保存到指定的记录（默认 '0.0'）"

msgid ""
"**XF_FX** Changes how the x.F+F.x amplitude contribution is computed when "
"symmetry is being used (default '1')"
msgstr "**XF_FX** 改变在使用对称性时 x.F+F.x 振幅贡献的计算方式（默认 '1'）"

msgid ""
"**DEGTHR:THRDEG** Threshold to test uncoupled degenerate states before "
"excitation energy calculation (default '1d-5')"
msgstr "**DEGTHR:THRDEG** 在计算激发能之前检验非耦合简并态的阈值（默认 '1d-5'）"

msgid ""
"**GA_DISK** In serial mode either use normal disk mode for GA's (set this to"
" true) or allocate heap memory (default)"
msgstr "**GA_DISK** 在串行模式下，要么对 GA 使用普通磁盘模式（将此设为 true），要么分配堆内存（默认）"

msgid ""
"**RESTART** Record to read/write :math:`t_1` amplitudes from/to (which can "
"then be used to restarting a CC2 calculation at, say, a different geometry "
"or with different settings than the previous one)"
msgstr "**RESTART** 用于读写 :math:`t_1` 振幅的记录（可用于在例如不同几何结构或与之前不同设置下重启 CC2 计算）"

msgid "Computing CC2 ground state densities and gradients"
msgstr "计算 CC2 基态密度和梯度"

msgid ""
"To compute relaxed ground state densities the logical options ``DIPOL`` and "
"``RELAXED`` can be used like (true\\|false cases are handled as 0\\|1 cases "
"with Molpro options):"
msgstr ""
"要计算弛豫基态密度，可使用逻辑选项 ``DIPOL`` 和 ``RELAXED``\\ ，例如（true\\|false 情形按 Molpro 选项的 "
"0\\|1 情形处理）："

msgid ""
"where ``DM``\\ =<*record.file*> can additionally be used to save the density"
" matrix in a dump record for later usage (e.g., for computing other 1st "
"order properties using the :doc:`properties program "
"<properties_and_expectation_values>`. If the ``RELAXED`` variable is not "
"given or if set to :math:`0` the program will compute the unrelaxed dipole "
"moment instead (and the corresponding unrelaxed density matrix will then be "
"saved by the ``DM`` option)."
msgstr ""
"其中 ``DM``\\ =<*record.file*> 还可用于将密度矩阵保存到转储记录中供以后使用（例如，使用 :doc:`properties "
"program <properties_and_expectation_values>` 计算其他一阶性质）。如果未给出 ``RELAXED`` "
"变量或将其设为 :math:`0`\\ ，程序将改为计算非弛豫偶极矩（此时相应的非弛豫密度矩阵将由 ``DM`` 选项保存）。"

msgid ""
"For computing ground state gradients the logical option ``GRAD`` can be used"
" like:"
msgstr "要计算基态梯度，可使用逻辑选项 ``GRAD``\\ ，例如："

msgid ""
"which will also compute the relaxed density matrix alongside (which again "
"may be saved in a record by using ``DM``\\ =<*record.file*>). Note that the "
"``GRAD`` option (as usual) does not need to be explicitly set if a "
":doc:`geometry optimisation <geometry_optimization_optg>` is being "
"performed, that is if the ``DF-CC2`` input command is being followed by "
"``OPTG``"
msgstr ""
"这也会同时计算弛豫密度矩阵（同样可通过 ``DM``\\ =<*record.file*> 保存到记录中）。注意，\\ ``GRAD`` "
"选项（如往常一样）在进行 :doc:`geometry optimisation <geometry_optimization_optg>` "
"时无需显式设置，即如果 ``DF-CC2`` 输入命令后跟 ``OPTG``"

msgid ""
"There are a few options to ``DF-CC2`` which are being used in the gradient "
"program specifically:"
msgstr "``DF-CC2`` 有几个专门在梯度程序中使用的选项："

msgid ""
"**GRAD_DFGX** Use DF (AO based) for the matrix\\*vector step in the "
"Z-Vector(CPHF) equation for the gradient (default=1)."
msgstr "**GRAD_DFGX** 在梯度的 Z-Vector(CPHF) 方程的矩阵\\*向量步骤中使用 DF（基于 AO）（默认=1）。"

msgid ""
"**MPP_OCC** Parallelise loop over occupied orbitals if "
":math:`N_{procs}/N_{occ}` > ``MPP_OCC`` (default=4.0)."
msgstr ""
"**MPP_OCC** 如果 :math:`N_{procs}/N_{occ}` > ``MPP_OCC``\\ "
"，则对占据轨道循环进行并行化（默认=4.0）。"

msgid "**PRINT_GRAD** Print different gradient contributions if set to > 0."
msgstr "**PRINT_GRAD** 若设为 > 0，则打印不同的梯度贡献。"

msgid ""
"**AX_MODE** Use MO based (=1) or AO based (=0) Fock matrix computation in "
"A.x step for the Z-vector equation (only used if ``GRAD_DFGX``\\ =1)"
msgstr ""
"**AX_MODE** 在 Z-vector 方程的 A.x 步骤中使用基于 MO（=1）或基于 AO（=0）的 Fock 矩阵计算（仅在 "
"``GRAD_DFGX``\\ =1 时使用）"

msgid ""
"**DENS_IJ_MODE** Switch between two different calculation modes for the occ-"
"occ density block (default=2)"
msgstr "**DENS_IJ_MODE** 在占据-占据密度块的两种不同计算模式之间切换（默认=2）"

msgid "**RELAXED** Compute relaxed dipole moment if ``DIPOL``\\ =true"
msgstr "**RELAXED** 若 ``DIPOL``\\ =true，则计算弛豫偶极矩"
